# FORMAT EXAMPLE ONLY. Not loaded.
#
# The checker reads `not_approved.txt` in this directory, not this file.
# Rename it only once you hold the real Issue 9 list and have read its reuse
# terms. A partial list passing R8 reads as compliance and is not.
#
# One entry per line. `bad = substitute`, or a bare word for no suggestion.

ensure = make sure
verify = make sure
confirm = make sure
check = make sure
utilize = use
commence = start
terminate = stop
prior to = before
subsequent to = after
in order to = to
approximately = about
sufficient = enough
